OL,3,ATrump, Putin and Xi release 'peace
OL,4,Adeclaration' after historic meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump and his
OL,7,FRussian and Chinese counterparts
OL,8,FVladimir Putin and Xi Jinping have
OL,9,Fissued a "joint declaration of peace"
OL,10,Ffollowing historic trilateral talks.
OL,12,FThe three leaders met for 90 minutes in
OL,13,FChina's south-eastern city of Shenzhen,
OL,14,Fon the sidelines of the Asia-Pacific
OL,15,FEconomic Cooperation (APEC) summit.
OL,17,FWhile the presidents have previously
OL,18,Fhad one-on-one meetings, these are
OL,19,Ftheir first trilateral talks.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
